==============================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 232

{
  "detail": "Attribute 'https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/default-context/P1' has 2 value keys (only one allowed)",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Conflicting Value Keys",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



